        "approval_date": "2024-12-20",
        "description": {
          "text": "Expanded weight reduction indication for BBS or POMC/PCSK1/LEPR deficiency obesity to include pediatric patients 2 to <6 years of age",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval sNDA provides for expansion of the weight reduction indication in adult and pediatric patients with syndromic or monogenic obesity due to Bardet-Biedl syndrome (BBS) or pro-opiomeranocortin (POMC), proprotein convertase subtilisin/kexin type 1 (PCSK1), or leptin receptor (LEPR) deficiency to include pediatric patients 2 to &lt;6 years of age based on results from trial RM-493-033 entitled, *A Phase 3 Multicenter, 1-Year, Open-Label, Study of Setmelanotide in Pediatric Patients Aged 2 to &lt;6 Years of Age With Rare Genetic Causes of Obesity*.",
              "doc_id": "ac06a310-e367-5542-9845-99d0c5c997dd",
              "line": 7
            }
