        "description": {
          "text": "Added indication to reduce excess body weight and maintain weight reduction long term in adults and pediatric patients aged 4 years and older with acquired hypothalamic obesity",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval sNDA provides for updates to the Prescribing Information and Patient Package Insert for addition of an indication to reduce excess body weight and maintain weight reduction long term in adults and pediatric patients aged 4 years and older with acquired hypothalamic obesity based on results from trial RM-493-040 entitled, \u201cA Phase 3, Double Blind, Randomized, Placebo-Controlled Trial to Evaluate the Efficacy and Safety of Setmelanotide in Patients with Acquired Hypothalamic Obesity.\u201d",
